{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mystic Tesserae is a game that combines Falling Sand simulation and a chill experience, where you use elements and spells to mould the world according to your will. Use elements to interact with every pixel you see (and even the ones you don't). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay</strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use a variety of Elements to discover the interactions between them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft and build according to your imagination\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Falling Sand</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Falling sand simulation where all pixels are simulated.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your imagination to overcome challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your creativity to build beautiful and unique designs</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sandbox</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create buildings and even whole forests according to your desires.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2.5D</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique perspective, being able to see what is behind and below other elements.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Circuits</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create circuits using different metals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a &quot;third&quot; dimension, this can get as complex as you wish.</p></li></ul></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3466370?t=1744913551","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3466370?t=1744913551","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466370/c64b9e081d7378ecd5e7e430d66aaca370be1557/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744913551","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466370/c64b9e081d7378ecd5e7e430d66aaca370be1557/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744913551","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mystic Tesserae is a game that combines Falling Sand simulation and a chill experience, where you use elements and spells to mould the world according to your will. Use elements to interact with every pixel you see (and even the ones you don't). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gameplay</strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use a variety of Elements to discover the interactions between them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft and build according to your imagination\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Falling Sand</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Falling sand simulation where all pixels are simulated.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your imagination to overcome challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your creativity to build beautiful and unique designs</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sandbox</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create buildings and even whole forests according to your desires.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2.5D</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique perspective, being able to see what is behind and below other elements.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Circuits</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create circuits using different metals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With a &quot;third&quot; dimension, this can get as complex as you wish.</p></li></ul></li></u